      "id": 900,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Trace exploration guidance",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "content": "### Trace Explorer\nTrace search is now **session-aware**. Start here from Session Explorer or Prompt Detail, use the `Session` variable to narrow the search, and only paste a trace ID when you want a specific timeline. Summary stats and the histogram reuse the same Trace List result set to avoid duplicate search queries.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      }
